          "title": "Small batches, stronger evidence",
          "sourceRef": "memory/decisions/staged-rollouts.md",
          "updatedAt": "2026-10-05T03:08:04.257Z",
          "excerpt": "# Small batches, stronger evidence\n\nDecision: ship in small, verified increments.\n\n## Why\nEvery release should have an observable outcome and a reversible rollout. Agent activity is not the same as verified progress.\n\n## Acceptance\n- A named owner reviews the evidence.\n- Tests exercise the intended behavior.\n- The rollback path is documented.\n",
          "truncated": false,
          "url": null
        },
